      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Solar  quoting, patience, installation all worked well. Hiccup which probably should have been foreseen with Energex objecting to our planned system set up as we added on to a current system rather that completely replace it. Not your usual straightforward job but David and his crew were able to re-evaluate and work out a second best cheaper solution than originally planned. Installation was straight forward except our facia was soft and the ladder left indents. David’s team repaired these and learned a bit about low sheen vs gloss paint and how it affects colour appearance. A few hiccups getting the colour match sorted, no thanks to the ineptness of Bunnings not giving good advice on paint. But David and his team persisted and we now have a fully functioning solar system. Thanks to David  and his team for seeing this through. If you chose these guys you won’t be disappointed with their dedication and service. Even following up weeks later.",
